# Plan 071 - the cross-language contract goldens are compared byte-exactly by
# `npm run contract:check`, so their on-disk line endings must be stable.
# Without this rule, git checks them out with CRLF on Windows
# (core.autocrlf=true) and the check reports every golden as stale on a
# pristine clone.
TraffSim3D-backend/tests/contract/snapshots/*.json text eol=lf
